---
title: 'Nx Agents at Scale'
description: 'Learn how Nx distributed task execution can dramatically improve CI performance in large monorepos with multiple applications and shared libraries.'
filter: 'type:Guides'
topics:
  - 'Benchmarks'
---

The benchmark workspace contains:

- 5 shared buildable libraries with 250 components each
- 5 Next.js applications with 20 application-specific libraries each
- 5 Cypress projects with deliberately slow end-to-end tests

The workflow compares the same 115-project workload on one GitHub Actions runner and 15 Nx Agents.

